= Tariffs and Trade War

The Republican administration has launched a sweeping tariff offensive against allies and adversaries alike. Markets shudder, prices rise, and farmers and manufacturers brace for retaliation.

- @tariff_oppose: Oppose the tariffs and defend consumers
- @tariff_selective: Support targeted tariffs, oppose chaos

@tariff_oppose
on-arrival: tariffs_done = 1; economic_growth -= 1; inflation += 1; unemployed += 0.3; working_dem += 2*(1-dissent); suburban_dem += 2*(1-dissent); intl_relation += 3; biz_relation += 3

Polling shows tariffs unpopular; the economy slows.

@tariff_selective
on-arrival: tariffs_done = 1; economic_growth -= 0.8; inflation += 0.8; working_dem += 2*(1-dissent); rural_dem += 1*(1-dissent); populist_strength += 2; abundance_dissent += 3

A nuanced position, which gets less attention than the slogans.
